{{#with enquiry}}
<p class="greeting">Dear <strong>{{#if full_name}}{{full_name}}{{else}}Traveller{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p class="lead">
  Thank you for writing to <strong>Tanzania Safari Magic</strong>. Your message has reached our hospitality desk in Arusha,
  and a safari consultant will personally review it. We aim to reply within <strong>24 hours</strong> with thoughtful, practical guidance — not a generic auto-reply.
</p>

<p class="section-label">What we received</p>
<div class="data-card">
  {{#if enquiry_id}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Enquiry reference</span>
    <span class="value">#{{enquiry_id}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if enquiry_type}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Enquiry type</span>
    <span class="value">{{enquiry_type}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if package_name}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Package of interest</span>
    <span class="value">{{package_name}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if preferred_travel_date}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Preferred travel date</span>
    <span class="value">{{formatDate preferred_travel_date}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if number_of_travelers}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Travellers</span>
    <span class="value">{{number_of_travelers}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
</div>

{{#if enquiry_message}}
<p class="section-label">Your message</p>
<div class="quote-box">{{enquiry_message}}</div>
{{/if}}

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>While you wait</strong><br>
  Feel free to share more detail by reply: travel month, group size, budget range, and must-see experiences (Great Migration, Big Five, Kilimanjaro summit, Zanzibar beach, and so on). The clearer your wishlist, the richer our proposal.
</div>

<div class="cta-row">
  <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/255695108009">WhatsApp for a faster reply</a>
  <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{#if site_url}}{{site_url}}{{else}}https://tanzaniasafarimagic.com{{/if}}/safaris">Explore safari ideas</a>
</div>

<p class="closing">Karibu — we are honoured you reached out, and we look forward to planning something memorable with you.</p>
{{/with}}
